The Google Messages collector is a separate process from the LVPT Command Center web application.

go.mau.fi/mautrix-gmessages, including pkg/libgm, is published under AGPL-3.0.
https://github.com/mautrix/gmessages
Pinned commit: ed5dc19eb2b4149ee242cf000c86a7150dca9947

This service does not copy that source into the web application. A binary built with -tags livelibgm links pkg/libgm and is covered by AGPL-3.0. The default binary does not link it and cannot open a Google session. The source of any networked libgm binary must be offered to the people who interact with it.

The Command Center receives normalized records through its own staging interface. It does not include libgm.
